      "updated": 1790782716283,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "class Maze(Grid[T]):\n\nWill use most of the \ndefault implementation of Grid[T]\nWill add the following properties: TODO: think what\n---------------------------------------------\n_cell: Cell\n_grid: list[list[T]]\n---------------------------------------------\n+ __init__(self, cell_factory: callable = Cell,\n     width: int, height: int, default_value: T)\n+ row(): Iterator[T]\n+ column(): Iterator[T]\n+ property(valid): bool\n    ...\nproperty(cell: Type[Cell[T]])\n+ __getitem__(self, y) -> list[T]\n+ __iter__(self) -> Iterator",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": "xF8CVyE0L6rBlTbZ2roRH",
      "originalText": "class Maze(Grid[T]):\n\nWill use most of the \ndefault implementation of Grid[T]\nWill add the following properties: TODO: think what\n---------------------------------------------\n_cell: Cell\n_grid: list[list[T]]\n---------------------------------------------\n+ __init__(self, cell_factory: callable = Cell,\n     width: int, height: int, default_value: T)\n+ row(): Iterator[T]\n+ column(): Iterator[T]\n+ property(valid): bool\n    ...\nproperty(cell: Type[Cell[T]])\n+ __getitem__(self, y) -> list[T]\n+ __iter__(self) -> Iterator",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
